 "offset_seconds": 1.7799999999997063,
 "words_heard": 206,
 "words": 206,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "We rowed out on the dark lake when the stars were in the sky",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 4.0,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We cast and hauled the empty nets till the morning sun came high",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 4.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We were washing out the tackle when the Teacher came along",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 4.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He climbed into my boat and said, now push us out from shore",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 4.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Put out into deep water",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 4.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And let down your nets for a catch",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Master, we worked hard all night and caught nothing",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 4.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But at your word I will let down the nets",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 4.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The nets began to tear, boys, the fish came leaping in",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 3.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We signaled to our partners, they came rowing to the din",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 4.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "We filled both boats so full of fish that they began to sink",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 4.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And I fell down before him and I couldn't even think",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 4.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Put out into deep water",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 4.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And let down your nets for a catch",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Master, we worked hard all night and caught nothing",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 4.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But at your word I will let down the nets",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 4.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Go away from me, Lord, for I am a sinful man",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 4.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 4.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "From now on you will be catching people",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 4.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "So they brought their boats to shore, left everything behind",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 44.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And followed him",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 3,
   "error_s": 48.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
